Well, well, well, there were spots where I was lost, but that was pretty good...

2239
02:08:29,631 --> 02:08:32,481
いや、いいね。ホロメンマップ面白いなあ。
Yeah, that was great! The Holomen Map is so fun!

2240
02:08:32,831 --> 02:08:38,331
